WEBVTT

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.530
Inter-High School Sports Festival

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:18.580
Boys Volleyball Final Tournament Round Three

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:20.830
"Fukuho Tech | Amasaka Comm"

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.190
Subaru!

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.580
"Subaru Mimura"

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:24.060
We're counting on you, Subaru!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.150
Give it to me!

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:41.060
Tomoki.

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:44.480
Set them all to me, and we'll be fine!

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.020
Right!

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:47.480
We can still do this!

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.060
We're not done yet!

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.190
"Fukuho Tech | Amasaka Comm"

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:56.560
Coach... I really want them to win.

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:58.020
Of course.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:02.190
Tomoki!

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:20.560
Go, Subaru!

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:26.810
Fukuho Technical High School.

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:28.980
For seven years straight,
they've been the reps for our prefecture

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:31.440
for both the Inter-High
and the Spring Tournament.

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:35.810
Seven years? So they've been winning
ever since we were in grade school?

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:39.350
Yup. And if we don't beat that undefeated team,

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:42.980
we won't be able to go to the
Spring Tournament representing Fukui.

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:45.400
Not until we beat that Mimura.

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:47.940
Who's Mimura?

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:52.100
Subaru Mimura... Fukuho's ultimate ace.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.010
Fukuho Tech

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.010
Amasaka Comm

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.270
He's also known as the Demon Bazooka

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:59.770
and is the best spiker in Fukui.

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:04.440
Subaru, don't forget this.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.560
"Fukui
Fukuho Tech"

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:07.060
Ochi, we los--

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.900
Next up is the finally the Spring Tournament.

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:13.270
You're gonna take me
to the center court, aren't you?

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.650
You make it sound so simple.

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:18.650
I am gonna take you though.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:19.650
Line up!

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:23.230
Oh, come on. You have next year, too.

